"description":"Imagine the scenario: you and your friends are bored on a Friday night. You feel like you’ve experienced everything that your town has to offer. You’ve been to all of the highest rated places on Yelp and local points of interest. Luckily, you have Hidden Adventures downloaded on your phone. A rush of new opportunity overcomes you as you open the app and see the iconic hot air balloon logo. A multitude of view points, forests, rope swings, beaches, swimming holes, live music venues, and hole in the wall restaurants appear alongside their titles on the map. Suddenly, you and your friends encounter a new problem: you don’t have enough time to explore all of these wonderful, compelling hidden adventures. \n\nNever be a tourist again. Some of the best adventures are spontaneous, unique and—most importantly—hidden. This application is a way to discover those types of adventures. When you are in a new location, search for the hidden adventures around you. A visit to one of these locations will provide an experience that the masses of sheep (aka tourists) won't even know about. Post your own adventures and share them with either your sidekicks or your community as a whole. Download Hidden Adventures to take part in the revolutionary exploration experience as it changes the world!", "averageUserRating":4.95000000000000017763568394002504646778106689453125, "trackCensoredName":"My Hidden Adventures", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/my-hidden-adventures/id1406681953?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", 
